    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ologendo lwa Vandu va Isiraeli Kutura Egebeti Kuzia Moabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yivi ni vika via vandu va Isiraeli vagenda mu lwa vaatura mu kivala cha Egebeti, mu miganda ji zihiiri ziavo mu vwimiliri vwa Musa na Haruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lilaga lia Yahova, Musa yang'oda mita gi vivala viosi viavavitiramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu va Isiraeli vaatura Egebeti lidiku liu kutanga liu mweli gwu kutanga gwu muhiga. Liali lidiku liukutanga lie lipasaka liu kutanga nilimali kuvita. Vatanga ologendo kutura mu lidaala lia Ramesesi na vandu va Egebeti ni vavateeleye zimoni. Yahova yaali mukingi wa vandu va Isiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ing'inga yiyi vandu va Egebeti vaali ni vayavira vana vaavo avayaayi vukutanga va Yahova yaali namali kwita. Yahova yakola yaga kumanyia ndi aveeye ni zinguru kuvita vanyasaye va Egebeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avandu va Isiraeli vatura Ramesesi ni valomba hokososa ha Sukozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisosa liavo lialonda ku liali ha Ezamu kundulu kwi changalangwi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura hene yaho nivirana ha Pi Hahirozi, ivugwi wa Baali Zefoni nivalomba hokososa ha Migidoli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaatura Pi Hahirozi nivavitira mu inyanza inzakanyu ni vazia muchangalangwe cha Shuri lwavagenda ku madiku gavaga vaduuka hokososa ha Mara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura hene yaho vazia ha Elimu, ha vasosera, kigira haali nivisinukilu via mazi komi na mbiri kandi misaala sabwini ji minazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vatura Elimu ni vazia kuduuka hokososa ahimbi ni inyanza inzakanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura hene yaaha vazia kuduuka hokososa mu changalangwi cha Sini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaatura mu changalangwi cha Sini ni vazia hokososa ha Dofuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutura hene yaaha, vazia kuduuka hokososa ha Alushi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vatura ha Alushi vazia ha Refidimu na hene yaaha si haali na mazi ga vandu kunwa mba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
